          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1050,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.05.030:block:1",
          "start": 670
        },
        "quote": "(b) Where any such basement, cellar or areaway is condemned by the City Engineer, the engineer shall, if the public safety requires it, barricade and close up the sidewalk or areaway, or any part thereof, adjacent to the building affected by the condemnation and keep the same barricaded and closed up until the changes or repairs are made. (Code 1981 § 40-285. Code 1995 § 26-3.)",
